  "sourceTitle": "Minted Cucumber Chutney",
  "sourceText": "Minted Cucumber Chutney\nBy: Kevin Tu\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n8 ounces Yogurt drained\n2 Seedless cucumbers peeled, diced\n1/4 cup Mint chiffonade\n2 tablespoons Finely-diced red onion\n1 tablespoon Fresh lemon juice\n1/4 teaspoon Cumin\nSalt to taste\nFreshly-ground black pepper to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Place the drained yogurt in a medium bowl. Add the remaining ingredients and season with salt and pepper to taste. Let sit at room temperature.",
